          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Jesus asked.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Seven loaves,” they answered.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He ordered the crowd to sit down on the ground. Then he took the seven loaves, gave thanks to God, broke them, and gave them to his disciples to distribute to the crowd; and the disciples did so. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They also had a few small fish. Jesus gave thanks for these and told the disciples to distribute them too. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Everybody ate and had enough — there were about 4,000 people. Then the disciples took up seven baskets full of pieces left over. Jesus sent the people away ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.8+MRK.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.8",
              "MRK.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and at once got into a boat with his disciples and went to the district of Dalmanutha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
